# Optional: use an HTTPS feedback receiver for the deployed static website.
# Leave unset for local Vite development (/api/feedback proxies to 127.0.0.1:4186).
# Production hides the feedback entry until this URL is explicitly configured.
# A deployment with its own same-origin receiver may set /api/feedback.
# Never put GitHub credentials in a VITE_ variable or any frontend file.
# VITE_FEEDBACK_API_URL=https://your-feedback-host.example/api/feedback
